=2 Walkthrough
!Giddeus1.jpg|right|Map of Giddeus
* Speak with Cid's Assistant {p:Raibaht} to start quest.

>**After this point, the rest of the quest can be completed on any job.**
* Speak with {n:Mighty Fist} in {z:Metalworks} (G-9) (lower level; inside Darksteel Forge) and you will receive a key item: {k:Letter from the Darksteel Forge}
* Travel to {z:Windurst Waters} and speak to {n:Cochal-Monchal} (F-8) (HP #1 - North Map - Optistery)
* Obtain a {i:Yagudo Cherry|Yagudo Cherry|4445} from either a vendor or the auction house.
** One is enough for multiple people doing the quest.
* Travel to {z:Giddeus} and trade the Yagudo Cherry to the ??? at H-14. This will spawn a NM: {m:Vaa Huja the Erudite}.
** You may want to clear the area before doing so.
* Defeat the NM and click on the ??? again. You will obtain a key item: {k:"Darksteel Formula"}
* (Optional) Return to Metalworks and speak with {n:Mighty Fist} again for additional dialogue.
* Return to Raibaht and speak with him to complete quest.

